    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93575" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σειρ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strain, filter</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cleopatra
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				3.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PFay.</u>
				134.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				1.102
			</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σειρώσουσιν</span> is prob. 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρώσουσιν</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Sm.
				<u>Je.</u>
				48.12
			</span></i>. (Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σειρεόω</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σειρέω</span>.) </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σειρῶ</span>, =
			<i>cimusso, provide</i> a garment <i>with a border</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dosith.
				p.435
			</span></i> K.</div>
